Provenance
==========

ws/src/fossbot_description contains URDF and STL meshes derived from
`fossbot_educational_description` in LRMPUT/FOSSBotEduSim, with the gazebo
plugin block removed (on real hardware the bridge publishes those topics
instead). `sync_description.sh` re-vendors them.

That upstream package declares no license, so fossbot_description does not
assert one. fossbot_bridge and fossbot_msgs are original to this repository and
are currently marked MIT -- change that if it does not match the group's policy.
